ngs in life. [...] The architectural vision behind Runwal Malabar emphasizes spaciousness, natural light, and breathtaking views. Each duplex apartment has been meticulously designed to maximize comfort and functionality, featuring expansive living areas, premium finishes, and state-of-the-art amenities. The thoughtful floor plans ensure privacy and grandeur, with every detail reflecting the developer's commitment to excellence. Large windows and private terraces frame spectacular vistas of the city skyline and the Arabian Sea, creating living spaces that are both inspiring and serene. [...] Key landmarks near Runwal Malabar include Schools: Campion School, Cathedral & John Connon School, Bombay Scottish School  \n  \n Hospitals: Breach Candy Hospital, Bhatia Hospital, Jaslok Hospital  \n  \n Restaurants: Soam, Gajalee Sea Food Restaurant, Busaba  \n  \n Bank/ATMs: HDFC Bank, ICICI Bank, Axis Bank  \n  \n Bus Stop: Teen Batti Bus Stop, Malabar Hill Bus Stop, Walkeshwar Bus Stop  \n  \n Metro/Railway: Charni Road Railway Station, Marine Lines Railway Station, Grant Road Railway Station  \n  \n Airport: Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport  \n  \n Petrol Pumps: Indian Oil Petrol Pump Malabar Hill, Bharat Petroleum Breach Candy, HP Petrol Pump Kemps Corner  \n  \n Shopping Mall: Atria Mall, Crossword Kemps Corner, High Street Phoenix","score":0.8455478,"raw_content":null,"id":"51d185-06"},{"url":"https://www.rezide.in/project/69897e5a18704e348af4f123","title":"Runwal The Residence | Napean Sea Road | Malabar Hill - Rezide","content":"Luxury Amenities: Includes facilities such as a swimming pool, gymnasium/fitness centre, children's play area, landscaped gardens, clubhouse and more for","score":0.82117355,"raw_content":null,"id":"d68e13-07"}],"response_time":3.59,"request_id":"e2e8b14a-6c1b-484e-93f0-86bb7fc0dd53"}